   Hangzhou, PEOPLES R CHINA, OCT 26-29, 2010},
Organization = {China Occupat Safety \& Hlth Assoc; Beijing Inst Technol; State Key Lab
   Explos Sci \& Technol; China Jiliang Univ; Henan Polytechn Univ},
Abstract = {In order to objectively and accurately understand hazard of dangerous
   chemical tanker car, this article assesses the risk of dangerous
   chemical tanker car accident. Firstly, based on the dangerous chemical
   tanker car accidents, the three aspects of the dangerous chemical tanker
   car accident risk were gained, namely ``human factor, vehicle factor,
   environment factor{''}. Secondly, the model was designed to assess the
   dangerous chemical tanker car accident risk by means of expert
   investigation and using the method of AHP and fuzzy comprehensive
   assessment. The assessment model target layer is dangerous chemical
   tanker car accident risk. The criterion layers, which are 3 parts, are
   the human factor, vehicle factor, environment factor. The 12 index
   layers are associated with the secondary indicators. They are driver
   business ability, driver physical condition, driver safety awareness,
   drivers emotional condition, pedestrian factor, vehicle structure,
   vehicle safety device, material, road terrain, road surface condition,
   road infrastructure, weather factor. By consulting experts, the weight
   of each index was constructed. Finally, the assessment model is applied
   to evaluate and analyze the dangerous chemical tanker car accident risk.
   This model was exemplified in a dangerous chemical tanker car. The
   results show that the assessment methodology of dangerous chemical
   tanker car accident risk is reasonable, effective and feasible.},
