   2013},
Abstract = {In order to distinguish car accidents and road traffic accidents
   definitions, measure the vehicle parts failures on the impact of car
   accidents and looking for leading causes of car accidents, proposed
   definition of road traffic accidents, re-definition of the car
   accidents, and the two were compared. In the analysis the cause of the
   car accidents, main start from the vehicle parts factors, find the
   direct cause of the accident, and use the fishbone diagram in-depth
   analysis the influence of human factors in vehicle design, manufacture,
   use, maintenance and management process. The results show that the
   understanding of car accident in China exists some deviation, for the
   study of the causes of the accident are mainly stuck in road traffic
   accidents, and showed to a certain extent exaggerated on the human
   factors, in particular the impact of drivers and pedestrians. Car
   accidents' causes investigation and analysis should be strengthen, to
