Note = {IEEE Region 10 Symposium (TENSYMP) - Good Technologies for Creating
   Future, Jeju, SOUTH KOREA, AUG 23-25, 2021},
Organization = {IEEE; IEEE Reg 10},
Abstract = {At present, road accident has become a regular headache for all people
   around the world. To overcome the situation, people are thinking of
   updating the way of driving and road law. Different brands of automobile
   companies are trying to invent different types of facilities in
   vehicles. The main focus of this paper is to ensure the life security of
   the drivers. There will be sensors for health monitoring system that
   will track the driver's health, such as heart rate, temperature, and
   whether or not the driver is drunk, as well as drowsiness. This
   prototype uses an ultrasonic sensor, which will detect very close
   vehicles and reduce its own speed. However, the engine will start based
   on driver health, where sensors will always observe the driver's lively
   movement. Car accident prevention with the health monitoring system of
   the driver can be a blueprint to reduce car accidents, and it will be
   cost-effective. This project is expected to have a significant effect on
   society and obtain better results.},
